          :Blank: 
          /help – Displays this help message.
          /guide – Points to the complete guide and rules.
          /nickname – How to set a nickname and profile picture.  
          /emoji – Guide on using and submitting emojis.
          /stopit – Switch between full notifications, no-refresh, no-link-preview, and do-not-disturb modes.
          /testrefresh – Shows a demo refresh popup visible only to you.
          /share – Create a safe redirect link (usage: /share URL). Must be at start of line. You can also manually use https://perchance.org/clickable-share#yourURL
          /spoiler, /sp, or /cw – Manually hide your image or video (like "Check this /sp URL out") with a warning overlay. This affects the pop-up preview only. The link text in the chat remains visible. 
          /slash – Show all slash font styles demo (𝗯𝗼𝗹𝗱, 𝓼𝓬𝓻𝓲𝓹𝓽, ͗͟g͈̈́̿l͋̎̇ỉ͔͆t͙̄͢c͕͒͐h͛̀̽, etc.)
          /d20 – Roll a 20-sided die with critical hit/fail alerts.
          /adult – Info and rules for entering 18+ chats.
          /shutup – Stops interaction with banned trolls.  
          /gallery – Info on submitting and switching galleries.  
          /nospam – Explanation of the no-spam rule.  
          /fail – Fix issues like failed generation or loading errors.  
          /missing – Possible reasons why your gallery post disappeared.
          /pg13 – Quick summary of the PG-13 Language Policy.
          /english – Multilingual reminder to use English in public channels.
          /norp – A polite reminder to move heavy roleplay to the #Roleplay channel.
          /neg – Info on how negative prompts are handled in FLUX.
          /gs – Info on how to use Guidance Scale overrides.
